* AD4021 ADC Front End Netlist
* Digitising a 1 V DC input with realistic conversion clocking

* DC Inputs and Supplies
V_IN IN 0 1.0
V_REF REF 0 5.0
V_VDD VDD 0 1.8
V_VIO VIO 0 1.8

* SDI tied to GND for standard 3-wire mode
V_SDI SDI 0 0.0

* Conversion Clock (CNV) - 1 MSPS, 20ns high pulse to initiate conversion
V_CNV CNV 0 PULSE(0 1.8 0 1n 1n 20n 1u)

* Serial Clock (SCK) - 50 MHz burst to clock out data after conversion completes
* Conversion time is ~320ns max. Burst runs from 350ns to 850ns every 1us.
V_GATE GATE 0 PULSE(0 1 350n 1n 1n 500n 1u)
V_CLK CLK 0 PULSE(0 1.8 0 1n 1n 10n 20n)
B_SCK SCK 0 V=V(GATE)*V(CLK)

* AD4021 Instance
* Pinout maps to the standard physical package order (10-Lead MSOP/LFCSP) used by the .subckt:
* 1:REF, 2:VDD, 3:IN+, 4:IN-, 5:GND, 6:SDI, 7:SCK, 8:SDO, 9:VIO, 10:CNV
X1 REF VDD IN 0 0 SDI SCK OUT VIO CNV AD4021

* Transient Analysis
* Runs for 3 microseconds to capture multiple full conversion cycles
.tran 0 3u

.end
